<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1371476393"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1468214181"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Difficult"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Jay Bombay / NEIMY"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Difficult"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:43.540"><div begin="00:03.680" end="02:43.540"><p begin="00:03.680" end="00:08.800" itunes:key="L1">I get upset, out of control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心烦意乱 失去理智</span></p><p begin="00:08.800" end="00:15.530" itunes:key="L2">Up in my head, there's a thunderstorm about to go loose<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胡思乱想 暴风雨即将来临</span></p><p begin="00:15.530" end="00:20.170" itunes:key="L3">I always regret keeping it there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我总是懊悔不已</span></p><p begin="00:20.170" end="00:24.170" itunes:key="L4">But I'll never get the words out anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我一言不发</span></p><p begin="00:24.170" end="00:26.470" itunes:key="L5">Just forcing a smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能强颜欢笑</span></p><p begin="00:26.470" end="00:28.510" itunes:key="L6">But my mind's running wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我心乱如麻</span></p><p begin="00:28.510" end="00:31.440" itunes:key="L7">And I try to come down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我试图冷静下来</span></p><p begin="00:31.440" end="00:34.030" itunes:key="L8">But it's too late now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是一切都来不及了</span></p><p begin="00:34.030" end="00:36.380" itunes:key="L9">All I wanted was to reach out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我唯一的心愿就是吐露心声</span></p><p begin="00:36.380" end="00:38.220" itunes:key="L10">Letting all my thoughts not break down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我不会沦落崩溃的境地</span></p><p begin="00:38.220" end="00:39.550" itunes:key="L11">You push me to an edge<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你将我逼入绝境</span></p><p begin="00:39.550" end="00:43.580" itunes:key="L12">It's like you're invinsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎你不可一世</span></p><p begin="00:43.580" end="00:45.940" itunes:key="L13">You never wanna know what I feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你永远不知道我心底的感受</span></p><p begin="00:45.940" end="00:48.290" itunes:key="L14">Never seem to get what I mean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎从未明白我的心意</span></p><p begin="00:48.290" end="00:53.550" itunes:key="L15">Everytime I talk you make things so difficult<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次我和你谈心 你总是让我不由分说</span></p><p begin="00:53.550" end="00:58.070" itunes:key="L16">And you're the best with arguments<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你最擅长狡辩</span></p><p begin="00:58.070" end="01:03.110" itunes:key="L17">Makes me forget the speech I practiced for an hour beforehand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我将事前准备的说辞忘得一干二净</span></p><p begin="01:03.110" end="01:07.180" itunes:key="L18">Yes, 'cause you shot me down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你总是奚落我</span></p><p begin="01:07.180" end="01:09.380" itunes:key="L19">Does that make you proud?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否引以为傲</span></p><p begin="01:09.380" end="01:13.700" itunes:key="L20">Well, I'll never get the words out anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧 我一言不发</span></p><p begin="01:13.700" end="01:15.710" itunes:key="L21">Just forcing a smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能强颜欢笑</span></p><p begin="01:15.710" end="01:18.400" itunes:key="L22">But my mind's running wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我心乱如麻</span></p><p begin="01:18.400" end="01:20.720" itunes:key="L23">And I try to come down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我试图冷静下来</span></p><p begin="01:20.720" end="01:23.400" itunes:key="L24">But it's too late now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是一切都来不及了</span></p><p begin="01:23.400" end="01:25.870" itunes:key="L25">All I wanted was to reach out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我唯一的心愿就是吐露心声</span></p><p begin="01:25.870" end="01:27.920" itunes:key="L26">Letting all my thoughts not break down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我不会沦落崩溃的境地</span></p><p begin="01:27.920" end="01:29.330" itunes:key="L27">You push me to an edge<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你将我逼入绝境</span></p><p begin="01:29.330" end="01:32.760" itunes:key="L28">It's like you're invinsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎你不可一世</span></p><p begin="01:32.760" end="01:35.200" itunes:key="L29">You never wanna know what I feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你永远不知道我心底的感受</span></p><p begin="01:35.200" end="01:37.610" itunes:key="L30">Never seem to get what I mean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎从未明白我的心意</span></p><p begin="01:37.610" end="01:42.440" itunes:key="L31">Everytime I talk you make things so difficult<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次我和你谈心 你总是让我不由分说</span></p><p begin="01:42.440" end="01:47.200" itunes:key="L32">I get so mad, mad, mad, mad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愤怒不已</span></p><p begin="01:47.200" end="01:51.340" itunes:key="L33">Ain't that sad, sad, sad, sad?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一点都不伤心</span></p><p begin="01:51.340" end="01:54.020" itunes:key="L34">'Cause all I wanted to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我想做的一切</span></p><p begin="01:54.020" end="01:55.980" itunes:key="L35">Was for my thoughts to just reach you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是让你知道我心中所想</span></p><p begin="01:55.980" end="02:04.020" itunes:key="L36">You make me so mad, mad, mad, mad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我愤愤不平</span></p><p begin="02:04.020" end="02:05.940" itunes:key="L37">All I wanted was to reach out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我唯一的心愿就是吐露心声</span></p><p begin="02:05.940" end="02:07.920" itunes:key="L38">Letting all my thoughts not break down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我不会沦落崩溃的境地</span></p><p begin="02:07.920" end="02:08.930" itunes:key="L39">You push me to an edge<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你将我逼入绝境</span></p><p begin="02:08.930" end="02:12.720" itunes:key="L40">It's like you're invinsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎你不可一世</span></p><p begin="02:12.720" end="02:15.040" itunes:key="L41">You never wanna know what I feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你永远不知道我心底的感受</span></p><p begin="02:15.040" end="02:17.690" itunes:key="L42">Never seem to get what I mean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎从未明白我的心意</span></p><p begin="02:17.690" end="02:22.510" itunes:key="L43">Everytime I talk you make things so difficult<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次我和你谈心 你总是让我不由分说</span></p><p begin="02:22.510" end="02:27.190" itunes:key="L44">I get so mad, mad, mad, mad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愤怒不已</span></p><p begin="02:27.190" end="02:31.390" itunes:key="L45">Ain't that sad, sad, sad, sad?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一点都不伤心</span></p><p begin="02:31.390" end="02:33.060" itunes:key="L46">'Cause all I wanted to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我想做的一切</span></p><p begin="02:33.060" end="02:35.850" itunes:key="L47">Was for my thoughts to just reach you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是让你知道我心中所想</span></p><p begin="02:35.850" end="02:40.100" itunes:key="L48">And everytime I talk you make things so difficult<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次我和你谈心 你总是让我不由分说</span></p><p begin="02:40.100" end="02:43.540" itunes:key="L49">So difficult<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以沟通</span></p></div></body></tt>